  "description": "Repeatedly remove adjacent duplicate characters from a string until no more are possible.",
  "target": "abbaca",
  "pseudocode": "1: let stack = []\n2: for char of s:\n3:   if stack.length > 0 && stack[stack.length - 1] === char:\n4:     stack.pop()\n5:   else:\n6:     stack.push(char)\n7: return stack.join('')",
